Third-party notices (not part of the MIT licence above)

MediaPipe Tasks Vision (@mediapipe/tasks-vision), Copyright Google LLC.
Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe/blob/master/LICENSE
Used as an npm dependency; its wasm runtime is copied from node_modules into the
game's public/wasm/ at install time. No MediaPipe source is included here.

Hand Landmarker model (hand_landmarker.task), Google LLC. Downloaded by
scripts/fetch-model.mjs from
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/1/hand_landmarker.task
and not redistributed in this folder. Google's download page and model card
state no separate licence for the file; MediaPipe is Apache License 2.0.
Model card:
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-assets/Model%20Card%20Hand%20Tracking%20(Lite_Full)%20with%20Fairness%20Oct%202021.pdf

One Euro filter: algorithm from Gery Casiez, Nicolas Roussel and Daniel Vogel,
"1 Euro Filter: A Simple Speed-based Low-pass Filter for Noisy Input in
Interactive Systems", CHI 2012. The implementation in src/oneEuro.js was written
from the paper.
